(NORTHSTAR MARITIME SYSTEMS \(FICTIONAL\) - SYNTHETIC DEMO DATA) Tj T*
(02. Remote and Hybrid Work Policy | Effective Date: 2026-01-01) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Notice: This is synthetic demonstration data, not a real company policy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1: Standard Hybrid Schedule) Tj T*
(- Eligible full-time employees may work remotely up to 2 days per week) Tj T*
(  \(typically Tuesday and Thursday, or as agreed with their manager\).) Tj T*
(- At least 3 days per week must be worked from the assigned office hub.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2: Probation Eligibility Restriction) Tj T*
(- New joiners are NOT eligible for routine weekly hybrid remote work during) Tj T*
(  their initial 90-calendar-day probation period \(see Onboarding Policy\).) Tj T*
(- Manager-approved ad-hoc remote days during probation are limited to urgent) Tj T*
(  IT or safety incidents documented in HR tickets.) Tj T*
