() Tj T*
(Section 3: Temporary Full-Remote Exception) Tj T*
(- Confirmed regular employees may request up to 10 business days per calendar) Tj T*
(  year of temporary full-remote work for documented family-care needs.) Tj T*
(- This exception requires written approval from both the direct manager and VP.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4: Core Hours and Attendance Precedence) Tj T*
(- On approved remote days, employees must remain reachable online during core) Tj T*
(  hours \(10:00 to 16:00 local time\) instead of physical desk badge check-in.) Tj T*
(- Precedence Rule: This clause explicitly supersedes Section 4 physical badge) Tj T*
(  check-in rules in 01_leave_and_attendance_policy.pdf on approved remote days.) Tj T*
(- Home-office equipment support is governed by the USD 600 one-time allowance) Tj T*
(  in 03_benefits_and_reimbursement_policy.md after 30 days of active service.) Tj T*
